### 1. Create task
POST http://localhost:8088/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn Spring Boot",
  "description": "Build a small REST API"
}

### 2. Get all tasks
GET http://localhost:8088/api/tasks

### 3. Get one task
GET http://localhost:8088/api/tasks/1

### 4. Filter by status
GET http://localhost:8088/api/tasks?status=TODO

### 5. Update task
PUT http://localhost:8088/api/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn Spring Boot",
  "description": "Finish TaskPulse",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}

### 6. Delete task
DELETE http://localhost:8088/api/tasks/1
